Hello <%= @user.full_name.presence || @user.email %>,

Thank you for your purchase! Your order #<%= @order.id %> has been placed successfully and is currently <%= @order.status.humanize %>.

Order Details
-------------
<% @order_items.each do |item| %>
<%= item.product_variant.product.title %>
Variant: <%= item.product_variant.name %>
Qty: <%= item.quantity %> × <%= format_currency(item.price) %>
Subtotal: <%= format_currency(item.subtotal) %>

<% end %>
Total Amount: <%= format_currency(@order.total_amount) %>

<% if @order.address.present? %>
Shipping Address
----------------
<%= @order.address.full_name %>
<%= @order.address.address_line_1 %>
<% if @order.address.address_line_2.present? %>
<%= @order.address.address_line_2 %>
<% end %>
<%= @order.address.city %>, <%= @order.address.province %> <%= @order.address.postal_code %>
<%= @order.address.phone_number %>
<% end %>

<% if @order.payment_method.present? %>
Payment Method: <%= @order.payment_method.name %> (<%= @order.payment_method.code.to_s.upcase %>)
<% end %>

We will email you again whenever your order status is updated.

Best regards,
AL Ecommerce Team
<%= @store_setting.email %>
